    - rid: 4707331699516899524
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle when a gate's lever is full and its shutter starts to rise (2 s)
    - rid: 4707331699516899525
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Floor intro banner objective part on a key-hunt floor whose exit is the gates. {n} = keys to find (3)
    - rid: 4707331721657843863
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'World text the first time the player steps into the looping corridor, before its corner seals it (shown 4 s): it is an optional side path, and past the corner there is no way back. ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU'
    - rid: 4707331721657843864
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'World text queued right after sub.loop.offer (shown 4 s): what solving the looping corridor gives. {n} = right decisions in a row needed (3). ALL CAPS like IT HEARD YOU'
    - rid: 4707331721657843865
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "One entry in the list of supplies the looping corridor gives when solved, shown as FOUND: <this>  \xB7  SPARE BATTERY  \xB7  ... (ALL CAPS, ~16 characters)"
    - rid: 4707331786811114157
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: F120 subtitle after the hunter's grab knocks the torch out of your hand (shown ~3 s, one line at the bottom). It = the hunter
    - rid: 4707331786811114158
