    - rid: 4707331786811114160
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'World text (the game speaking, not the hunter) on the hunter-lesson card (42 pt goal line, shrinks to fit): it learned the player''s voice from the microphone. ALL CAPS, one short line'
    - rid: 4707331789613957191
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Floor intro banner: added to the rule line when Oaths are sworn. {rank} = Oath rank'
    - rid: 4707331789613957375
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Floor 1 (Hilde): first sight of the door that appeared behind the player (shown 3 s, ALL CAPS)'
    - rid: 4707331789613957376
